# EvtGen user decay file for k4DTF test samples
#
#   B0 -> D*(2010)- pi+,  D*- -> anti-D0 pi-,  anti-D0 -> K+ pi-   (+ c.c.)
#
# Decay descriptor (k4DTF / LHCb notation):
#   B0 -> (D*(2010)- -> (D~0 -> K+ pi-) pi-) pi+
#
# Use with DelphesPythia8EvtGen_EDM4HEP_k4Interface ... 511 Bd_SIGNAL 1
# Only the B chosen as signal follows this chain; all other hadrons decay
# according to DECAY.DEC.

Alias      Bd_SIGNAL       B0
Alias      Bdbar_SIGNAL    anti-B0
ChargeConj Bd_SIGNAL       Bdbar_SIGNAL
#
Alias      MyD*-           D*-
Alias      MyD*+           D*+
ChargeConj MyD*-           MyD*+
#
Alias      MyAnti-D0       anti-D0
Alias      MyD0            D0
ChargeConj MyAnti-D0       MyD0
#
Decay Bd_SIGNAL
  1.000    MyD*-      pi+          SVS;
Enddecay
CDecay Bdbar_SIGNAL
#
Decay MyD*-
  1.000    MyAnti-D0  pi-          VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay MyD*+
#
Decay MyAnti-D0
  1.000    K+         pi-          PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay MyD0
#
End
